    "source": "Bad Eden Bulwark + Shadow Courier v1.0 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The world has two ways of saying no to change. You learn one of them today.</em></p><p><strong>On gaining Bulwark Initiation 1 you receive:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>Athletics (Violence)</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>one tool of your choice</strong> (any single tool tracked as a skill on your sheet).</p></li><li><p><strong>Violence OP cap +3</strong> and <strong>Siege OP cap +2</strong> on the faction your character belongs to.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Frame Dice</strong> pool comes online (persistence — d8 dice, spend to absorb hits or fuel doctrine effects). Pool max = max(2, ceil((Violence value + Bulwark Initiation) / 3)), capped at 8.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Ruin Charges</strong> pool comes online (inevitability — single-use charges, spend to fuel offensive doctrine effects). Same pool-size formula.</p></li></ul><p>Both pools refill on a Soma Break. How you generate them depends on your chosen Path; see your doctrine's L1 feature.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
